ShadouCMDB third-party notices
==============================

This file lists third-party material that is bundled into ShadouCMDB as-is (not through a package
manager) and whose licence requires a notice. Rust crates and npm packages are covered by their
own licence metadata and the allow list in backend/deny.toml.


